{"id":4928,"date":"2024-09-13T18:23:32","date_gmt":"2024-09-13T18:23:32","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/?page_id=4928"},"modified":"2025-02-26T08:57:12","modified_gmt":"2025-02-26T08:57:12","slug":"swat4hcls-2025-biohackathon","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/barcelona2025\/programme\/swat4hcls-2025-biohackathon\/","title":{"rendered":"SWAT4HCLS 2025 Biohackathon"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>SWAT4HCLS Biohackathon 2025 \u2013 Call for Participation and Topic Proposals<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The SWAT4HCLS Biohackathon, inspired by the well-known DBCLS Biohackathon, returns this year as part of the SWAT4HCLS conference, taking place from <strong>February 24 to 27, 2025<\/strong> in Barcelona.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Traditionally, the biohackathon has been held on the final day of the event. However, based on positive feedback, we\u2019re continuing with last year\u2019s format where participants can start hacking from day one. This gives you more time to collaborate and focus on projects that interest you.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Important dates:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Conference: February 24\u201327, 2025<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Biohackathon: Runs throughout the event<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For registration and event details, visit: <a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4hcls.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">www.swat4hcls.org<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Shape the Biohackathon Topics<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We are currently collecting suggestions for biohackathon topics. If you have ideas or challenges you\u2019d like to work on, please share them on social media. Tag <strong>@andrawaag<\/strong> (on Bluesky, LinkedIn, or via other channels), and use the hashtag <strong>#SWAT4HCLS<\/strong> so we can include your suggestions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I\u2019ll review the submissions and highlight selected topics on the <strong>Biohackathon page<\/strong>. This is a great opportunity to shape the discussions and focus areas of the event.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We look forward to your participation and ideas\u2014let\u2019s work together to make this a productive and collaborative biohackathon!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Biohackathon topics<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Auto ontology mapping with deepseek<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">On slack: #swat4hcls2025-hack-1-auto-ontology-mapping-with-deepseek <\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Using mystmd for sparql rdf<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">On slack: #swat4hcls2025-hack-2-using-mystmd-for-sparql-rdf<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">SPARQL Glioblastoma and Tuberculosis data<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">On slack: #swat4hcls2025-hack-3-glioblastoma-tb-fair-data<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Interactive experience for data owners<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">On slack: #swat4hcls2025-hack-4-interactive-experience-for-data-owners<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">AI ready datasets<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">On slack: #swat4hcls2025-hack-5-ai-ready-datasets<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>SWAT4HCLS Biohackathon 2025 \u2013 Call for Participation and Topic Proposals The SWAT4HCLS Biohackathon, inspired by the well-known DBCLS Biohackathon, returns this year as part of the SWAT4HCLS conference, taking place from February 24 to 27, 2025 in Barcelona. Traditionally, the &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/barcelona2025\/programme\/swat4hcls-2025-biohackathon\/\">Continue reading <span class=\"meta-nav\">&rarr;<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":4843,"parent":4825,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-4928","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4928","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4928"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4928\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5131,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4928\/revisions\/5131"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4825"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/4843"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4928"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}